# A133P base OS stock harvest allowlist.
# One device path per line; comments and blanks ignored.
# Directories are captured recursively; symlinks are dereferenced (tar -h),
# so list soname paths (what the dynamic linker/dlopen actually request),
# not the fully-versioned real files.

